# Quantum-Sector Market Analytics Pipeline

Status: In Progress

An automated pipeline that tracks and analyzes publicly traded quantum computing companies — **IonQ, Rigetti, D-Wave, and Quantum Computing Inc.** — against broader market benchmarks (**QTUM and S&P 500**).

The project combines Python, SQL, R, Qiskit, Docker, and GitHub Actions to answer two questions:

1. How has the quantum computing sector performed as an investable market?
2. Can a quantum algorithm (**QAOA**) select a better portfolio than a classical optimization method?

> This README is a living document and will be updated as the project progresses.

